# fu15-verified-nav.keys — visually verified front-end navigation (FU-15).
# Single step (see docs/ghidra/FU13_headless_input.md): the KEYS tail is one
# comma-paced AUTOTYPE command; `,` is a 2*pace (0.2 s) pause.
#
# Timeline (validated frame-by-frame against captures/session-probe-14c18-v3,
# -v5 and -v6 videos):
#   10 s  enter  — skip the looping intro; the title screen is live by ~10.3 s
#   18 s  down   — GAME SELECT is interactive by ~15 s; move highlight
#                  Friendly -> Leagues (the old menu-nav.keys pressed this at
#                  14 s and raced the title->menu transition; 18 s is safe)
#   22 s  enter  — open the LEAGUE SELECT screen (International flag grid)
#   34 s  esc    — back to GAME SELECT (focus returns to the right column,
#                  highlight reset to Friendly)
#   42 s  left   — switch focus to the left column, highlight Load Game
#   46 s  down   — highlight Options
#   52 s  enter  — open the OPTIONS screen (Music/SFX/Language/Super VGA)
#
# This sequence reaches LEAGUE and OPTIONS deterministically. It does NOT
# reach probe site 7 (FUN_00014c18); see docs/ghidra/FU15_visual_capture.md
# for the six-attempt campaign, the screen inventory and the navigation model.
10 enter , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , down , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , enter , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , esc , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , left , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , down , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , , enter
